 "director": {
  "mode": "hand",
  "notes": "No coins on their spending (the blamed act); Hell not drawn. Two paths for «ليميز الله الخبيث من الطيب», starting after the Name. STAGING v4: c1 (36): a market by day with three polytheists at the centre. Their spending is carried only by the word chips and the gloss: no give gesture (it is the series' charity gesture and ends in a reward sparkle) and no coins plate on the blamed spending (picture review S2). They wring their hands on 36:14 (regret: both tafsirs) under a falling-leaf plate that undraws (their wealth gone), and lower their heads on 36:16 (overcome; As-Sa'di: humiliation); nobody fights or leaves. On 36:17-21 (gathered to Hell) the camera goes wide and nothing is drawn for Hell (no fire, no darkness). c2 (37) stays ambient: Allah sorting the evil from the good and heaping it into Hell (the unseen)."
 },
